 place", "text": "We were approached by a guide and -- for once -- took him up on the offer of a tour.  We were glad we did.  There is so much here that we would not have understood on our own.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2014-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "CE17BD1010C065CCCAEBAE30F7C518C9", "name": "Sandy B", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Cai22", "username": "Cai22", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/13/19/00/1c/sandy-b.jpg", "contribution_count": 36, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 30029, "location_name": "Allentown", "location_name_detailed": "Allentown, Pennsylvania"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2015-07-05", "published_at_date": "2015-07-05"}, {"review_id": 285814686, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r285814686-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "great historical.....place but requires CARE", "text": "FOR....hindus ...a great place to visit......but remember u cannot offer prayers directly to sacred shiv ling...no photography inside temple is allowed....rest i would recommend to take darshan from left side as it will give much less crowd ,although we visited on SAAVAN first MONDAY....and it was jam packed......cleanliness is an issue but historical importance overwhelms it.....", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2014-08-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "C39023845D4870D8D0ADA7879FBF90AD", "name": "Dr GOPAL ASHISH SHARMA", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Gopalashish", "username": "Gopalashish", "ava